& [TypedFields]
  + all *_sha256 fields use unchanged ContentDigest with algorithm sha256 and lowercase64hex value; no string digest aliases
  + UUID commit profile status authority branch remote project path reference and identity fields are String with explicit source-bound validation; commits lowercase40hex UUIDs lowercase canonical nonnil
  + request authority_packet_request is B1OaprRequest; a5_receipt is exact OdcvVerificationReceipt; effect_account is unchanged TwvEffectAccount
  + input_class is unchanged KcvInputClass; references are Vec<String> one through48 unique safe nonempty strings; fixture_only and all comparison/truth fields are bool
  + observed_unix_ms a4_observed_unix_ms observed_cdrive_free_bytes minimum_cdrive_free_bytes declared observation bytes artifact bytes and total_artifact_bytes are u64
  + attempts retries cleanup artifact_count deterministic_replay_count required_fresh_process_replay_count are u8; manifest effect_count is u32
  + bundle build_junctions is Vec<EocvJunctionObservation> of exactly2; upstream_identities is Vec<B1CDriveProductionPreparationUpstreamIdentity> of exactly4
  + role_observations is Vec<EocvRoleObservation> of exactly5; reserved_ref_observation is EocvReservedRefObservation
  + junction.kind is EocvJunctionKind with snake_case unit variants junction missing other unknown; target is Option<String> required as an explicit key, Some iff junction and otherwise None serialized null
  + role.kind is unchanged B1CDriveProductionPreparationRoleKind; state is EocvPresenceAssertion with snake_case absent present unknown; reserved ref uses the same state enum
  + comparison_account is EocvComparisonAccount; mismatch_reasons is Vec<EocvMismatchReason>; each reason is a snake_case unit variant in the fixed order below
  + artifacts is Vec<EocvEvidenceArtifact> of exactly25 payloads with path String bytes u64 sha256 ContentDigest
& [ClosedValues]
  + mismatch reasons in exact order carrier_commit_mismatch branch_mismatch remote_mismatch project_mismatch observation_time_mismatch capacity_below_floor build_junction_mismatch upstream_identity_mismatch role_not_absent reserved_ref_not_absent
  + invariant positive fields a5_correspondence_receipt_verified preparation_plan_replayed proposal_plan_correspondence_verified packet_replayed descriptor_correspondence_verified observation_bundle_bytes_matched comparison_reconstructed
  + global false fields production_authority_claimed fresh_observation_proved observation_source_identity_proved observation_source_completeness_proved observation_freshness_proved atomic_observation_proved decision_signature_binds_a6_observation expected_carrier_authority_proved live_authorization_admitted private_execution_permit_present production_broker_projection_present physical_preparation_authorized ready_for_physical_execution execution_authorized
  + ten comparison fields carrier_commit_matches branch_matches remote_matches project_matches observation_time_matches_a4 capacity_meets_minimum build_junctions_match upstream_identities_match all_roles_absent_asserted reserved_ref_absent_asserted
  + comparison account has all ten Booleans then mismatch_reasons then all_expectations_match; conjunction and reason order recomputed
& [CounterAndFramingRules]
  + one attempt zero retry zero cleanup; two deterministic replays and at least two externally observed fresh processes per profile
  + four self-digest domains use UTF-8 fixed domain NUL canonical form with only own digest replaced by SHA256 empty bytes
  + retained files add exactly one LF; raw-form/candidate identities omit it and manifest artifact hashes include it
  + canonical serialization preserves explicit null keys and all typed declaration order; Deserialize then exact reserialize equality refuses missing Option keys or alternate escaping
  + receipt nestedA5 shape adds one structured layer only; imported and aggregate bounds remain enforced without changing ceilings
